# Long names Epic's compiler takes (#724): a class of 960 characters with a
# field of 992 (UEFN 43.12, ++Fortnite+Release-43.12-CL-60598086, admits the
# Book's valid class, Bugs/FORT-555217-VeryLongIdentifier.versetest:18, and
# runs it, followup-book2/long-ident-class-1024-control: field 42), and a
# field of 1024 characters, the longest identifier (one of 1025 is refused,
# 3655; at 1024, a class's name passed that check, long-ident-class-1024).
Class___ := class:
    Var_____:int = 42
    F():int = 1
holder := class:
    :int = 7
Main():void =
    Print("field {Class___{}.Var_____}")
    Print("longest {holder{}.}")
